10. Future Expansion

The longer-term design aims to support four six-dot cells, giving a total of 24 tactile dots.

Expansion will require validation of the additional servo channels, power distribution, mechanical alignment, firmware mapping and refresh behaviour.

The four-cell configuration is a stretch goal. The initial priority is to build and validate a reliable single six-dot cell before expanding the system.

